@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Stack-safe expression facts: shared arena, structural classes, CEK1

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #495057
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F1F3F5
  BorderColor #495057
}

component "function CPG\nunary · binary · ordered AST" as CPG #DBE4FF
component "explicit extraction PDA\nenter · child · assemble frames" as PDA #FFF3BF
component "node tape N\npostorder operator records" as NODES #C3FAE8
component "operand tape O\nscalars · Expression(node id)" as OPERANDS #D3F9D8
component "exact class interner\noperator + typed operand classes" as CLASS #E5DBFF
component "ExprUniverse\nstable dense fact ids" as UNIVERSE #D0EBFF
component "borrowed logical views\nExprKeyRef · ExprOperands" as VIEW #E5DBFF
component "explicit lifecycle machines\ncmp · hash · debug · drop" as LIFE #FFF3BF
component "canonical CEK1 tree\nversioned nodes + operands" as CEK #C5F6FA
component "bounded decoder / Serde\nbyte cursor · strict validation" as DECODE #FFD8A8
component "typed rejection\nnode · operand · string · byte · work" as ERROR #FFE3E3

CPG --> PDA : sorted roots and source-order children
PDA --> NODES : append completed operator
PDA --> OPERANDS : append scalar / prior child id
NODES --> CLASS
OPERANDS --> CLASS
CLASS --> UNIVERSE : deduplicate exact structure
NODES --> VIEW
OPERANDS --> VIEW
VIEW --> LIFE : explicit heap events/cursors
VIEW --> CEK : expand one logical root
CEK --> DECODE : serialize_bytes
DECODE --> NODES : canonical standalone arena
DECODE --> OPERANDS : checked partitioned tape
PDA --> ERROR : cap/allocation failure
DECODE --> ERROR : malformed/cap failure

note bottom of PDA
  Active child edge -> Opaque(NodeId).
  Completed child -> reuse stable arena id.
  No source-depth native recursion.
end note

note bottom of CLASS
  Class equality compares complete typed descriptors.
  It is collision-free and arena-local.
  Public cross-arena ordering remains structural.
end note

note bottom of CEK
  Shared DAG storage is permitted in facts.
  CEK1 expands sharing to one canonical tree:
  child < parent, contiguous subtrees, one parent.
end note

legend bottom
|= Colour |= Meaning |
|<#DBE4FF>| source CPG |
|<#FFF3BF>| explicit pushdown/lifecycle machines |
|<#C3FAE8>| flat operator ownership |
|<#D3F9D8>| flat ordered operands |
|<#E5DBFF>| structural identity and logical views |
|<#D0EBFF>| dense analysis universe |
|<#C5F6FA>| canonical persistence |
|<#FFD8A8>| bounded decoding |
|<#FFE3E3>| typed rejection |
endlegend
@enduml
